- `node scripts/check-public-less.mjs src/vehicle-summary.less` → `PASS 1 Less file(s)`(exit 0)
- `stylelint src/vehicle-summary.less --config .stylelintrc.json` → exit 0,无任何告警(`max-nesting-depth: 0`、`selector-class-pattern` BEM、`selector-max-compound-selectors: 1` 等均满足)

